.TH PROMETHEUS-OPENSEARCH-DASHBOARDS-EXPORTER 1 "2026-08-14" "" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
prometheus-opensearch-dashboards-exporter \- export OpenSearch Dashboards
metrics for Prometheus
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B prometheus-opensearch-dashboards-exporter
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B prometheus-opensearch-dashboards-exporter
queries the OpenSearch Dashboards status API and exposes status and process
metrics over HTTP for collection by Prometheus-compatible monitoring systems.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-url " URL"
OpenSearch Dashboards address from which to fetch metrics.
The default is
\fBhttp://localhost:5601\fP.
.TP
.BI \-\-port " PORT"
TCP port on which the exporter serves HTTP requests.
The default is
\fB9684\fP.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show command-line help and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B OPENSEARCH_DASHBOARDS_USER
User name for authenticating to OpenSearch Dashboards.
.TP
.B OPENSEARCH_DASHBOARDS_PASSWORD
Password for authenticating to OpenSearch Dashboards.
.SH ENDPOINTS
.TP
.B /metrics
Prometheus metrics endpoint.
.TP
.B /
Exporter information page.
.PP
Other paths return HTTP status 404.
.SH SEE ALSO
.UR https://github.com/canonical/prometheus-opensearch-dashboards-exporter
Project homepage
.UE
